	<comment xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xml:lang="en">Time required to approach (1-1/e) of the final output value of a detector (about 63%) (Kitchin, Astrophysical Techniques, IoP, Table 1.1.2).</comment>
